{"seq":3,"slug":"cold-start-personalization","title":"新用户与新市场的个性化冷启动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/personalization/cold-start-personalization","wordCount":2559,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"新用户与新市场的个性化冷启动\">新用户与新市场的个性化冷启动</h1><p>个性化系统在成熟市场的老用户身上表现最好，而这两类人群恰恰不是增长来源。真正决定业务天花板的是两个冷启动场景：<strong>新用户</strong>（没有行为数据）与<strong>新市场</strong>（没有本地行为数据，可能连商品池都是新导入的）。它们的困难程度不同——新用户的困难是「不知道他要什么」，新市场的困难是「不知道这里的人要什么，且模型参数是从别处搬来的」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-冷启动的两种缺失\">核心概念：冷启动的两种缺失</h2><p>把冷启动拆成「缺什么」，可以看出为什么不能用一个方案解决。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    C[冷启动] --&gt; N1[新用户]&#10;    C --&gt; N2[新市场]&#10;    N1 --&gt; M1[缺个体信号]&#10;    N1 --&gt; M2[群体信号可用]&#10;    N2 --&gt; M3[缺群体信号]&#10;    N2 --&gt; M4[跨市场迁移可用]&#10;    M2 --&gt; S1[用群体先验兜底]&#10;    M4 --&gt; S2[用迁移学习适配]&#10;    S1 --&gt; R[默认排序 + 上下文]&#10;    S2 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    C[冷启动] --&gt; N1[新用户]\n    C --&gt; N2[新市场]\n    N1 --&gt; M1[缺个体信号]\n    N1 --&gt; M2[群体信号可用]\n    N2 --&gt; M3[缺群体信号]\n    N2 --&gt; M4[跨市场迁移可用]\n    M2 --&gt; S1[用群体先验兜底]\n    M4 --&gt; S2[用迁移学习适配]\n    S1 --&gt; R[默认排序 + 上下文]\n    S2 --&gt; R</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>缺失的信号</th>\n<th>仍然可用的信号</th>\n<th>主要手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新用户（老市场）</td>\n<td>个体画像、个体行为</td>\n<td>群体统计、上下文、会话内实时行为</td>\n<td>群体先验兜底 + 快速适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新市场（新站点）</td>\n<td>本地群体统计、本地模型参数</td>\n<td>商品属性、跨市场迁移知识、上下文</td>\n<td>迁移学习 + 探索预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时新用户 + 新市场</td>\n<td>以上全部</td>\n<td>商品属性、上下文、跨市场先验</td>\n<td>全局基线 + 激进探索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"新用户-群体先验与快速适应\">新用户：群体先验与快速适应</h2><p>新用户第一次搜索时，个体信号为零。但系统仍掌握大量信息：站点的主流偏好、当前查询的意图类型、设备与时段。策略分两层。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是群体先验兜底。</strong> 站点级或查询级的群体偏好向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{u}_{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8539em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接代理个体偏好：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>pers,new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>e</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{s}_{\\text{pers,new}}(d) = \\bar{u}_{g}^\\top \\vec{e}_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pers,new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户在无个体数据时被归入的群组。群组的划分可以很粗（站点 + 设备类型 + 时段），因为它的作用只是「比完全随机好一点」。用 <a href=\"personalization-signals\">用户画像、行为信号与实时兴趣</a> 里的门控融合，个体信号的置信度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = n/(n+k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时自动归零，群体先验自然接管——<strong>这是门控融合的主要设计动机</strong>，它让冷启动不需要单独的代码分支。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是会话内快速适应。</strong> 新用户的价值在于他马上就产生行为：第一次点击、第二次查询、加购。会话内信号的门控常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 应该取得很小（比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>），让个性化强度在几次交互内快速爬升：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>session</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>session</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>session</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{\\text{session}} = \\frac{n_{\\text{session}}}{n_{\\text{session}} + 2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">session</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">session</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">session</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三次交互后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>，已经能让会话信号显著影响排序。这与老用户的长期画像形成互补：老用户靠画像，新用户靠会话，两者共享同一个门控框架。</p>\n<p>新用户冷启动有一个必须防的失败模式：<strong>首屏过度自信</strong>。如果第一次请求就用一个弱的群体先验加上很强的探索性探索，用户看到的第一屏可能完全离谱，直接流失。稳妥的做法是<strong>首屏以相关性为绝对主干</strong>（个性化强度接近 0），把个性化的爬升留给第二屏之后——用户在首屏验证了「这个搜索能用」之后，才有耐心接受个性化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新市场-跨市场迁移的三种方式\">新市场：跨市场迁移的三种方式</h2><p>新市场的困难不是「没有这个用户的数据」，而是「没有这个市场的数据」。系统有成熟市场的模型与统计，但直接搬过去未必有效：A 市场认为「红色 = 喜庆」在促销季加分，B 市场可能相反。</p>\n<p>迁移的方式有三种，成本与风险递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>需要的数据</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数迁移</td>\n<td>复用成熟市场的模型权重，直接上线</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>本地适配差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征迁移</td>\n<td>共享特征定义与商品表示，重训本地模型</td>\n<td>少量本地行为</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元学习</td>\n<td>用多市场数据训练「快速适配」的初始化</td>\n<td>多市场数据</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>全局基座 + 本地小模型残差</td>\n<td>少量本地行为</td>\n<td>需要在线路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐路径是<strong>参数迁移起步 + 特征迁移跟上</strong>。参数迁移的合理形态不是「把 A 市场模型权重直接拿到 B 市场」，而是把<strong>商品与查询的表示层</strong>（embedding）当作可迁移的部分，把<strong>打分层</strong>（权重）当作需要本地数据重新学习的部分。理由是表示层学习的是「跑鞋和运动鞋在语义上接近」这类跨市场通用的知识，而打分层学的是「这个市场更在意价格还是品牌」这类本地偏好。这种切分通常称为<strong>共享塔 + 本地头</strong>，在双塔模型上做起来很直接：共享商品塔与查询塔，本地化打分的头部网络。</p>\n<p>新市场的另一个特殊约束是<strong>商品池本身可能是新的</strong>。跨境场景里，商品从母市场导入，标题与属性是原语言的翻译，图片里可能含原市场的文字与价格标签。这会让本地用户的相关性判断与模型都失准。因此冷启动的第一步往往是<strong>类目映射与属性补全</strong>——把导入商品挂到本地类目树上，补齐本地关心的属性（比如日本的尺码习惯、德国的能效标签）。这个环节属于商品域的工作，但它的质量直接决定了排序模型在新市场的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索预算-把不确定性花在刀刃上\">探索预算：把不确定性花在刀刃上</h2><p>新市场最大的问题是<strong>没有足够的行为数据来学习</strong>。而如果不做探索（永远只展示当前最优结果），数据永远不会产生。这是一个典型的探索-利用权衡，需要用<strong>显式的探索预算</strong>管理。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的方案是指数衰减的探索配额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_t = \\epsilon_0 \\cdot \\gamma^{\\,t / T_{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5357em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上线初期的探索比例（比如 0.15），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是半衰期（比如 30 天）。它的行为是：上线初期有 15% 的流量用于探索新商品/新排序，随着数据积累逐步降低到稳定值（比如 0.02）。这个预算必须是<strong>显式的参数</strong>而不是隐含在模型里，因为它需要被业务方知晓——15% 的探索流量意味着短期内转化率会低于最优。</p>\n<p>探索的对象可以是商品（给新商品曝光机会）或排序策略（尝试不同的参数组合）。前者解决「新商品没有数据」的问题，后者解决「新市场没有最优参数」的问题。两者的预算可以分开管理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R[新市场请求] --&gt; D{有本地模型?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| P1[参数迁移: 共享塔 + 默认头]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| P2[本地模型]&#10;    P1 --&gt; E1[探索预算: 高]&#10;    P2 --&gt; E2[探索预算: 衰减]&#10;    E1 --&gt; M[混排]&#10;    E2 --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; O[观测]&#10;    O --&gt; T[本地训练数据积累]&#10;    T --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    R[新市场请求] --&gt; D{有本地模型?}\n    D --&gt;|否| P1[参数迁移: 共享塔 + 默认头]\n    D --&gt;|是| P2[本地模型]\n    P1 --&gt; E1[探索预算: 高]\n    P2 --&gt; E2[探索预算: 衰减]\n    E1 --&gt; M[混排]\n    E2 --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; O[观测]\n    O --&gt; T[本地训练数据积累]\n    T --&gt; D</pre><p>上图是一个自我强化的闭环：探索产生数据，数据训练本地模型，本地模型降低对探索的依赖。这个闭环的<strong>收敛速度</strong>是衡量冷启动系统好坏的核心指标，通常用「本地模型超过迁移基线所需的样本量」或「AUC 追平成熟市场模型的周数」来度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估冷启动-不要把新用户混进整体指标\">评估冷启动：不要把新用户混进整体指标</h2><p>冷启动的效果如果只看整体指标，会被淹没。一个实用做法是把评估指标按<strong>用户生命周期阶段</strong>切分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分群</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关注指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首访</td>\n<td>首次会话</td>\n<td>首屏点击率、会话内搜索次数、次会话回访率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早期</td>\n<td>2-5 次会话</td>\n<td>类目覆盖率、首次加购转化率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td>6 次以上会话</td>\n<td>转化率、客单价、复购率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新市场整体</td>\n<td>站点上线后 N 周内</td>\n<td>相对成熟站点的转化率缺口收窄速度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中「次会话回访率」是新用户个性化最值得盯的指标。新用户流失通常发生在第一会话，如果首屏体验差，他不会给第二次机会。因此新用户个性化的优化目标不应是「第一会话转化率最大化」，而应是「让用户愿意回来」——这两者在短期可能冲突（激进探索可能提升长期数据量但损伤首会话体验），需要用探索预算的上限来做平衡。</p>\n<p>新市场的整体指标还需要一个<strong>外部基线</strong>。因为新市场的绝对转化率低于成熟市场是正常的（用户习惯未形成、物流体验未成熟），所以不能拿「转化率绝对值」判断个性化系统好坏。合理的做法是构造一个对照组：<strong>关闭个性化</strong>（纯相关性排序）的流量桶，看个性化相对它的增量。这个增量在新市场往往是负的早期、转正的后期——早期的负增量恰恰说明迁移的参数不适配，是必须观测的信号而不是要掩盖的失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷启动分两类：新用户缺个体信号（群体信号仍可用），新市场缺群体信号（跨市场迁移可用）；同时发生时只能靠全局基线 + 激进探索。</li>\n<li>门控融合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = n/(n+k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 让新用户冷启动无需单独的代码分支：个体信号置信度为 0 时群体先验自然接管。</li>\n<li>新用户的两层策略是群体先验兜底 + 会话内快速适应（会话门控常数取 2 到 3）；首屏应以相关性为绝对主干。</li>\n<li>新市场迁移推荐「共享表示塔 + 本地打分层」：表示层跨市场通用，打分层需本地数据重学。</li>\n<li>新市场的第一步常是类目映射与属性补全——排序模型的上限由商品域的数据质量决定。</li>\n<li>探索预算用显式指数衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_t = \\epsilon_0 \\gamma^{t/T_{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0858em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8914em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0664em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5357em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 管理，且必须是业务方知晓的参数。</li>\n<li>评估按用户生命周期阶段切分，新用户重点看次会话回访率；新市场必须设「关闭个性化」的对照桶，负增量是必须观测的信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新用户与新市场的个性化冷启动","id":"新用户与新市场的个性化冷启动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：冷启动的两种缺失","id":"核心概念-冷启动的两种缺失"},{"level":2,"text":"新用户：群体先验与快速适应","id":"新用户-群体先验与快速适应"},{"level":2,"text":"新市场：跨市场迁移的三种方式","id":"新市场-跨市场迁移的三种方式"},{"level":2,"text":"探索预算：把不确定性花在刀刃上","id":"探索预算-把不确定性花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"评估冷启动：不要把新用户混进整体指标","id":"评估冷启动-不要把新用户混进整体指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"在通用排序上的个性化重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/personalization/personalized-rerank"},"next":{"title":"活动坑位与商品注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/campaign-injection/campaign-slots"}}